{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An erotic visual novel  told through a cinematic mix of still renders and animated scenes. Game of Hearts aims to deliver a dramatic, down-to-earth, romance narrative that is augmented and heightened with hints of supernatural fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/extras/0d00e8e7eee39f7faeee5d03f1dd2f9e.poster.avif?t=1766085096\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/extras/0d00e8e7eee39f7faeee5d03f1dd2f9e.webm?t=1766085096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have the ability to hear people's innermost thoughts and feelings.</strong>\u00a0Because of this, you always knew you were different, that you were <i>special</i>. However, you never expected to learn that the reason why is because the blood of a <i><strong>demon</strong></i> runs through your veins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/extras/dd0dab43d6520516c77cb81ca0fcbf76.poster.avif?t=1766085096\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/extras/dd0dab43d6520516c77cb81ca0fcbf76.webm?t=1766085096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out there is a whole other world out there, hidden in plain sight. Dark forces struggle for control in a fierce war of succession-\u00a0 you must earn your seat at the table by using your <strong>irresistible, devilish charm</strong>\u00a0to <strong>seduce women into joining your harem of loyal followers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATURE NARRATIVE:</strong> a deeply human drama with a touch of otherworldly fantasy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANIMATED SEX SCENES:</strong> a multitude of fully animated scenes with beautiful graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THRILLING ROMANCE:</strong> compelling &amp; twisted love affairs that tug at the heart-strings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770250?t=1766085096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770250?t=1766085096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/2163b91be63d14de262f657efe4c77308023844a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766085096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770250/2163b91be63d14de262f657efe4c77308023844a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766085096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is intended for mature audiences and contains depictions of frequent sexual interactions as well as bleak, potentially frightening scenarios. The content in this game includes but is not limited to-\r\n\r\n-References to sexual assault/abuse\r\n-Seduction, manipulation, & unbalanced power dynamics\r\n-Themes of infidelity\r\n-Biblical themes (angels & demons)"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Multi-Chapter Series</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game of Hearts is the first entry in a planned multi-game series.</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An erotic visual novel  told through a cinematic mix of still 